God of Jacob for his help,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Whose hope is in the Lord his God:","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Which made heaven, and earth,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"The sea, and all that therein is:","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Which keepeth truth for ever:","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Which executeth judgment for the oppressed:","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Which giveth food to the hungry.","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"The Lord looseth the prisoners:","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"The Lord openeth the eyes of the blind:","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"The Lord raiseth them that are bowed down:","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"The Lord loveth the righteous:","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"The Lord preserveth the strangers;","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"He relieveth the fatherless and widow:","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"But the way of the wicked he turneth upside down.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"The Lord shall reign for ever,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Even thy God, O Zion, unto all generations.","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Praise ye the Lord.","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/eng_cpb/PSA/146.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/eng_cpb/PSA/147.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/eng_cpb/PSA/145.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":10}